<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-08T06:24:33.304Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:24:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has bombed a health centre in Thailand's Tak province and struck Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, claiming resistance fire from Thailand, while resistance forces used drones to attack a Christian Bible school, killing three female students. An airstrike on a residence in Mrauk-U killed a pregnant woman and injured ten civilians. The military is moving ahead with April parliamentary by-elections in conflict-hit Sagaing, Chin and Shan, expanding voting to areas of ongoing fighting. Dead Starlink terminals are being repurposed to locate and kill people. There were 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNZVJZN3pQLTFLRllYeDJQbi1IeHlheFYzZDlRczVMVklsdmZPdVIwUXpEVVdNbXJxX3FQbVVUdnVycnk2MkY5VzJwaFhIZW5aODloeExEQ1V2ZUdnVHcxVjNZQVlvVm1OS0FGV3h6OTBjb3lsakVRZ244OEZ3b1NpU3NWcUEtcHdwM1JrcVo0TjBSVVhIVVEwRUhVRGEtYVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOZGgtWXJTWl9tbjhEU1lyY19OS0VoUkZjV1JNdjdXbDdPV3NUa2dGTzlETXVaTmJpRWpqa2NNdkQwcXpvTGktY2lWb0FWZE5HYkt6ZTQ5Sjd3MEl1RUhFcTRYaEtzYkNVUUlTX3VoSWxTbUxCYUlfZUJxLVFoY1ZRUF9xVnRSTEs2Tkx0cl8tdjFWSkRBTGw5WHhOSXJPdkpXNUVuZg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE8yOTQ2OHVzSDlDaG4yN2NXWkJQTGltZ2xVR2FNNW9FV2JPZ0JPcE5vQjhhb2lkQkJlSGR1N1NaX3E3TjZfTjRCMW54SDhiR2szYjAxUThMdFo1enVOdGdBRkNaNXhDRDI0N3UtUFNaNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Narinjara News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE9VMW1ReU1jbzFfbWJDcEdPVmdBZnFJZnJyRXVKbFMyVVEwbENEZHVja25Od3JqYndmX3g5SzM2ZktfQmh4TUtOTXFjSEFJOV9xVmhES2dhaWNSaUtOY0UyTXhoNHpBWEQ3bFV0NmxLWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Na